- [ ] 5. README: add under the nightly jobs list `- \`src/jobs/weekly-csat.js\` writes \`exports/csat-weekly.json\`: ratings received and average score per agent over the past seven days.` and change "Three jobs" to "Four jobs". *Evidence: diff shown.*
- [ ] 6. Commit: `git commit -m "feat: weekly per-agent CSAT summary job"`.

